  "definition": "Unusual Operating Conditions",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-10-10",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400) #10393, eff 9-1-13; ss by #12643, eff 10-10-18 (formerly Env-Or 406.10) (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400)",
